#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:53
msgid "Using Startup Disk Creator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:55
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"Originally a Tutorial: https://discourse.ubuntu.com/t/create-a-bootable-usb-"
"stick-on-ubuntu/14011/\n"
"| Summary | Use your Ubuntu desktop to create a bootable USB stick that can "
"be used to run and install Ubuntu on any USB-equipped PC. |\n"
