msgid "Open KDE ISO Image Writer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:133
msgid ""
"In the {guilabel}`ISO image` field, select the downloaded Ubuntu image. KDE "
"ISO Image Writer starts verifying the image according to the checksum files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:135
msgid ""
"In the {guilabel}`USB drive` field, make sure that the correct USB stick is "
"selected."
