"KDE ISO Image Writer with a selected USB drive and a verified ISO image. It "
"says \"The ISO image is valid\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:139
msgid ""
"Click {guilabel}`Create` to start writing the Ubuntu image to USB. Confirm "
"with your password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:141
