#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:143
msgid "Using the Linux command line"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:145
msgid ""
"The `dd` image writer is available on all Linux systems. You can use it even "
"on minimal systems without any graphical environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:148
#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:310
msgid ""
"The `dd` tool is designed for advanced users. If you specify the wrong "
