#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:153
#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:363
msgid ""
"Make sure that the USB stick is large enough for the Ubuntu image. If it's "
"too small, the image writer might silently fail."
