#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:8
msgid ""
"Download and install the latest version of Rufus from the [rufus.ie](https://"
"rufus.ie/) website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:10
msgid ""
"If you're using Windows 7, install [version 3.22](https://github.com/pbatard/"
"rufus/releases/download/v3.22/rufus-3.22.exe) of Rufus. On Windows XP or "
"Vista, install [version 2.18](https://github.com/pbatard/rufus/releases/"
"download/v2.18/rufus-2.18.exe)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:12
msgid "Launch Rufus. If prompted, allow online updates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:15
msgid ""
"Rufus presents many options in its interface. It's safe to leave most of "
"them with their default values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:18
msgid "Insert your USB stick. It appears in the {guilabel}`Device` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:20
msgid ""
"If {guilabel}`Device` shows the wrong USB device, select the correct one "
"from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:22
msgid "![Selected a USB drive in Rufus](/images/rufus/rufus-detects-usb.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:22
msgid "Selected a USB drive in Rufus"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:24
msgid ""
"Click {guilabel}`SELECT` next to {guilabel}`Boot selection`. Choose the "
"Ubuntu image file that you've downloaded and confirm by clicking {guilabel}"
"`Open`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:26
msgid ""
"If the button reads {guilabel}`DOWNLOAD` instead, click the dropdown and "
"change it to {guilabel}`SELECT` first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:28
msgid "![Selected the ISO file in Rufus](/images/rufus/rufus-iso-selected.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:28
msgid "Selected the ISO file in Rufus"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:30
msgid ""
"If you've already tried Rufus and the USB stick failed to boot on your "
"system, change {guilabel}`Partitioning scheme` to {guilabel}`GPT` and check "
"that {guilabel}`Target system` is set to {guilabel}`UEFI (non CSM)`. This "
"works on modern systems that disable legacy compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:32
msgid "Click {guilabel}`START` to write the image to USB."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:34
msgid ""
"Rufus tells you that the Ubuntu image is an *ISOHybrid image*. This means "
"that the same image file can be used as the source for both a USB stick and "
"a DVD."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:36
msgid "Confirm the *Write in ISO Image mode* option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:38
msgid ""
"![\"ISOHybrid image detected\" dialog](/images/rufus/rufus-isohybrid-"
"image.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:38
msgid "\"ISOHybrid image detected\" dialog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:40
msgid ""
"If Rufus asks to download additional files to complete writing the image, "
"select {guilabel}`Yes` to continue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:42
msgid ""
"Rufus warns you that all data on the USB device is about to be destroyed. "
"Double-check that you've selected the correct device and confirm by clicking "
"{guilabel}`OK`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:44
msgid ""
"![Rufus warning you about data loss](/images/rufus/rufus-data-warning.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:44
msgid "Rufus warning you about data loss"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:46
msgid ""
"Rufus is now writing the image to USB. This usually takes around 10 minutes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:48
msgid "![Rufus copying ISO files](/images/rufus/rufus-copying-iso-files.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:48
msgid "Rufus copying ISO files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:50
msgid ""
"When Rufus has finished writing to the USB device, the Status bar says "
"{guilabel}`READY`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reuse/usb-using-rufus.txt:52
msgid "Click {guilabel}`CLOSE` to complete the write process."
