#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:399
msgid ""
"We're using the `/dev/rdisk<N>` device here rather than `/dev/disk<N>`. This "
"refers to a \"raw device\" interface to the same disk, which is faster."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:401
msgid "The `bs=4m` option increases the write performance and it's optional."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:403
