#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:408
msgid "`dd: /dev/disk<N>: Resource busy`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/create-a-bootable-usb-stick.md:409
msgid ""
"Make sure that the disk is not in use. Open the Disk Utility and unmount the "
"volume (don't eject)."
